{"document":1,"title":"user in #gpt4_4929293b:sharegpt_rqvR1Ep_0: I'm trying to help first-year college students dev...","updated_at":"2023-04-12T06:42:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"Sure, here is a one-year action plan based on the SMART plan chart I created earlier. I will divide it into four segments, each spanning three months: First Three Months ------------------ * Apply to at least 10 internships per week in the field of interest and tailor the resume and cover letter accordingly. * Attend at least one public speaking workshop/seminar and practice delivering speeches in front of small audiences. * Attend at least two networking events and aim to make at least one meaningful connection at each event. * Join a student organization and get involved in planning at least one event. Second Three Months ------------------- * Follow up with the internships that have been applied to and prepare well for the interviews. * Attend at least one public speaking workshop/seminar and deliver a presentation in front of a small audience. * Attend at least two networking events and aim to make at least one meaningful connection at each event. * Take up a leadership role in the student organization and plan an event successfully. Third Three Months ------------------ * Secure an internship with a major company and start working on building a professional network within the company. * Deliver a presentation to an audience of at least 25 people with confidence and clarity. * Attend at least two networking events and aim to make at least one meaningful connection at each event. * Continue taking up leadership roles in the student organization and work towards planning another successful event. Fourth Three Months ------------------- * Continue working on the internship and gaining experience in the field of interest. * Attend at least one public speaking workshop/seminar and deliver a presentation in front of a larger audience. * Attend at least two networking events and aim to make at least one meaningful connection at each event. * Collaborate with the student organization to plan a major event and lead a successful execution.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"gpt4_4929293b:sharegpt_rqvR1Ep_0\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #gpt4_4929293b:c0dbabb8: I'm trying to plan out my week and was wondering w...","updated_at":"2023-04-09T16:54:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been meaning to watch The Devil Wears Prada again, it's one of my favorite movies. By the way, I was thinking of watching something on Disney+ this week, do you have any recommendations? I just watched Hamilton over the weekend and loved it, so maybe something similar?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"gpt4_4929293b:c0dbabb8\"}"}
{"document":3,"title":"user in #gpt4_4929293b:cae65795_1: I'm thinking of organizing my phone's photos and v...","updated_at":"2023-05-04T19:34:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I think the hybrid approach sounds like a good idea. I can create broad categories for the main activities and then sub-albums for more specific themes. Speaking of which, I've been meaning to back up my phone data, which I last did about 6 weeks ago. Do you have any recommendations for cloud storage services or external hard drives for backing up my photos and videos?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"gpt4_4929293b:cae65795_1\"}"}
{"document":4,"title":"user in #gpt4_4929293b:b4ed7223_3: I've been listening to a lot of indie folk music l...","updated_at":"2023-05-24T22:45:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been listening to a lot of indie folk music lately and I'm curious, can you recommend some similar artists to Bon Iver and Fleet Foxes? By the way, I just got back from a local music festival about three weeks ago featuring indie rock bands and discovered Phoebe Bridgers - her album \"Punisher\" is on repeat.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"gpt4_4929293b:b4ed7223_3\"}"}

